Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they number about 10,000,\Njust as you estimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that dilapidated old castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How pitiful, dying amid those ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those fishing boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How carefree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When a battle is about to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:13.82,Italics,song,0,0,0,,In hindsight, "What lies ahead of us?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.91,0:01:19.20,Italics,song,0,0,0,,was just a luxury
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:25.04,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Driven by necessity, we run forth,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:31.13,Italics,song,0,0,0,,robbed even of the choice to turn back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:34.76,Italics,song,0,0,0,,I long for the one I await
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:38.10,Italics,song,0,0,0,,under the pale moon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:41.27,Italics,song,0,0,0,,shining on my weak self
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.10,Italics,song,0,0,0,,and on this curse, all the same
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:48.19,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Though the winds cross the distant skies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:51.40,Italics,song,0,0,0,,and countless stars call on you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:54.99,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Even sorrow has mellowed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:58.87,Italics,song,0,0,0,,making it hard to cry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:01.96,Italics,song,0,0,0,,While there's only one beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:05.75,Italics,song,0,0,0,,the end point is not set in stone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:09.09,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Never trust in fate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:14.47,Italics,song,0,0,0,,The hero you'll become was once afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mu mu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.32,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 7: A NEW BEGINNING
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.32,0:02:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pilika.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bad guys come, I'll beat them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to be captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't trust that Shu guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's lives depend on today's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:03:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to trust Shu and fight as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You protect Pilika and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.69,0:03:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected,\Nthe enemy is surrounding the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They have absolute\Nconfidence in their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They intend to use brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lord Solon Jhee.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Our formation is shallow,\Nleaving the rear unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind us is nothing but wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A few enemy remnants\Nat our rear won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't those former South Window soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to fight our comrades?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, all soldiers\Nwho surrender will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread a rumor\Nthat all POWs will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,begin the attack!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence catapult fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them up. Shoot them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Break down the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it time for the signal yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't relent! Victory is within our grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Now! Give the signal!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!\NThere were no ambush units nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A separate force?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A surprise attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take aim and shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Riliu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will... protect everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The glowing shield reported in Muse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! That's the boy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,who inherited the Bright Shield Rune\Nfrom Master Genkaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu will lead us to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time\Nto fight the Highland Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For the citizens of South Window,\Nand for the late Lord Granmeyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,let us rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're going to be killed anyway,\Nwe must fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat the Highland Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the South Window soldiers defecting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.81,0:07:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We should retreat before we're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.03,0:07:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back! All forces, retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Highland Army is retreating!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Riliu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory... What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Two River City?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it within 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:08:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But we invaded to capture Muse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack another city\Nwithout His Majesty's permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the King order you to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We continue our advance\Nuntil we eradicate those swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you object,\Nstop me by killing me right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my commander, Lord Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I will prepare for the expedition at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've not seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jowy Atreides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The youth who killed Anabelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Work hard for Highland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked me earlier how many I've killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,you should become a Kage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:09:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing people blindly\Njust on orders is not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you kill the mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect what is most precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Most precious"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm known as Kage. I don't have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have something so precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd risk everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Watch me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every one of you fought well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategist Shu's plan worked brilliantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A successful strategy\Ncalls for everyone's effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Everyone fought hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Freed's rumor worked well too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But today's key contributor is\Nnone other than Riliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You really did well, Riliu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a team effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, your Rune's power\Ngave everyone courage, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The South Window soldiers\Nregained courage too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We won today,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but the question is what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,With the fall of Muse,\Nthe City-States have fractured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate,\Nevery city will be conquered by Luca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one thing we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Unite our forces in this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Make this place our base\Nto fight the Highland Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And what we need\Nis the power to unite and lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shu, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have talent as a strategist,\Nbut not the power to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That leader is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu. No, Lord Riliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.24,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You should become\Nthe leader of the New States Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please show us the path to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, a leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.00,0:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.01,0:11:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Riliu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of Genkaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Genkaku, the hero once exiled\Nby the City-States.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You bear the same Bright Shield Rune\Non your right hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and you defeated Solon Jhee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Many people will see hope in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And above all, we saw a light within you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,a light that the era requires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your power\Nto defeat Luca Blight and restore peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Exiled by the City-States?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that have to do\Nwith Grandpa Genkaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How about giving him time to think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Riliu, take your time\Nbefore you make your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:11.94,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,SOLON JHEE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.02,0:12:14.94,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,FREED Y
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.53,0:12:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu, Nanami.\NThere's something I want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.41,0:12:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Something Anabelle wasn't able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,About 30 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Highland and the City-States fought\Na major war, staking everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Leading the States Army
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,was Mayor Darell of Muse,\NAnabelle's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Against him was Highland's general,\NHan Cunningham.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when it seemed Highland would win,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a hero appeared from the City-States.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He had the Bright Shield Rune\Non his right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your adoptive father, Genkaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Genkaku's actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the City-States recovered,\Nmaking it a close battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Genkaku and Han came\Nfrom the same village near the border
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and were best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bright Shield and the Black Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The two were true rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Crossing swords countless times,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,they realized this was a meaningless war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Genkaku and Han forged a truce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,People on both sides, tired of war,\Ngladly supported it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for Darell,\Nwho felt upstaged by Genkaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Darell insisted the border town of Kyaro\Nbelonged to the City-States.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Negotiations stalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,King Agares Blight of Highland suggested\Na duel between Genkaku and Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.41,0:13:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyaro's allegiance\Nwould be decided by their duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Genkaku was handed a sword by Darell,\Nand Han by King Agares.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the duel representing\Ntheir nations began.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Genkaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.80,0:14:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings, no matter who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Genkaku! Our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't he fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he get scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Han is victorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this acceptable, Lord Darell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You defiled a sacred duel, you traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Genkaku, you are permanently exiled\Nfrom our City-States!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Genkaku left the City-States in silence,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and your hometown of Kyaro{\i}\N{\i1}became Highland's.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the truth came out years later.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Darell had ordered Genkaku's sword\Nto be coated with lethal poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:14:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If he won, they planned\Nto exile him for using foul tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.94,0:15:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Genkaku realized it\Nand couldn't raise his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So win or lose, he'd be exiled?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His name was cleared,\Nbut he never returned to the City-States.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You two know what happened after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,To Genkaku, a quiet life with you two
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,was more important\Nthan returning to the City-States.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's as much as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa went through all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Genkaku was betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The City-States betrayed Genkaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecting Riliu to lead us because he\Ninherited that Rune is perhaps selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.32,0:15:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Riliu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,decide for yourself\Nwhether you'll be our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, I'll make Shu understand,\Neven if I have to slug him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The 4th Unit was defeated at North Window!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They suffered massive losses\Nfrom the same Rune magic used in Muse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy took advantage\Nof our loss to strike South Window,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,forcing our army to evacuate--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Solon Jhee. That useless fool!!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.41,0:16:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe we lived in Kyaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So much has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And we've come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Having you and Jowy\Nwould've been enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Genkaku and Han\Nwere like Jowy and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this Rune destiny, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:17:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You are your own person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A leader? I'm against it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate seeing you in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate seeing you hurt or sad even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I figured you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Genkaku would surely say the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I've never forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Something Grandpa Genkaku told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That day, I was playing with the animals.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before I knew it,{\i}\N{\i1}I wandered deep into the forest.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Genkaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You protected the animals well. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be strong
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu, if you want to be strong,\Nyou must be kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When protecting someone dear to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're able to exceed your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Become kinder and stronger than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"Someone dear to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be just you and Jowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, everyone here\Nis a precious comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no match for Grandpa Genkaku,\Nbut I want to protect everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that you've already\Nmade up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's join everyone and eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no hero like Grandpa Genkaku,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't do anything alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, stand with me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect the people you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Riliu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gengen will fight too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.36,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's beat that bastard Luca together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Lord Riliu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As your strategist,\NI will serve you with everything I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so impressive.\NI'll support you all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Leknaat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Heir to the Gate Rune\Nand emissary of the Great Balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.01,0:19:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu, you have inherited\Nthe Bright Shield Rune.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.23,0:19:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The wheel of fate turns once more,\Nand many Stars gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby entrust you\Nwith the Tablet of Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The names that appear here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.07,0:19:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,they are your allies\Nand will be your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Leknaat's apprentice, Luc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Tablet of Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will be joining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But only because Lady Leknaat\Nordered me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.05,0:20:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Viktor and Flik.\NYou're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.47,0:20:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.97,0:20:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say that.\NWe fought by his side long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a sharp tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but his magic skill is the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Riliu, many destinies cross your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend who inherited\Nthe Black Sword Rune
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,is also swept up in fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Jowy right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your paths will be painful at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, look ahead and march on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.52,0:21:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The destiny of the Bright Shield\Nhas been set in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Its counterpart, the Black Sword,\Nwill also be drawn into fate's maelstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bright Shield gathers Stars\Nand grows in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Black Sword follows\Nits own convictions,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,carving a path toward its destined future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Carve a path..."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That suits me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.63,0:21:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead and march on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will carve my own path,{\i}\N{\i1}and fulfill my destiny without delay!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:21:58.40,On Top,sign,0,0,0,,NEW STATES ARMY, DUNAN CASTLE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.48,0:21:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunan Castle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cool name!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we gotta make it a fine castle\Nthat lives up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, I finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet this hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:28.26,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Leading into tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:35.52,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Burning with heat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:42.36,Italics,song,0,0,0,,The door of night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.07,0:22:50.04,Italics,song,0,0,0,,It's glowing red
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.37,0:22:57.17,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Time after time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:23:01.63,Italics,song,0,0,0,,No matter
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.71,0:23:07.18,Italics,song,0,0,0,,how long it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:12.27,Italics,song,0,0,0,,I will get it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.89,0:23:19.44,Italics,song,0,0,0,,While I am alive here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:25.86,Italics,song,0,0,0,,Holding so tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:29.78,Italics,song,0,0,0,,with my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.66,0:23:36.08,Italics,song,0,0,0,,the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:42.42,Italics,song,0,0,0,,behind my eyes

